{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wanted big war strategy without the time commitment. Plan on a turn-based map, fight the battles in real time, and lead tribes like the Synths and Ronin through short, replayable campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/b7e968bb0464897b58e0328417640977.webp?t=1768527900\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.poster.avif?t=1768527900\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.webm?t=1768527900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.mp4?t=1768527900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each tribe comes packed with their own <strong>abilities, units, and upgrades</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/55648e07c0b53a6521bf4e7ea1973995.webp?t=1768527900\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.poster.avif?t=1768527900\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.webm?t=1768527900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/0f759418aca38891b251432cb6a1108f.mp4?t=1768527900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring <strong>glory to your tribe</strong> by seizing islands teeming with enemies, strange artifacts and <strong>game-changing events</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/6b617751e0ae6d70f7561b0390e495cb.webp?t=1768527900\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.poster.avif?t=1768527900\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.webm?t=1768527900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/1d5d4b4513294212dafff736652d0cfc.mp4?t=1768527900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack and slash through enemies with devastating <strong>abilities</strong> while commanding your lads in <strong>real-time battles</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/76eb109ad85473095b5a35abc15b8ffe.webp?t=1768527900\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.poster.avif?t=1768527900\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.webm?t=1768527900\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/ef327c2caa3edd0dd6f43b2331d750b4.mp4?t=1768527900\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit lads and mighty <strong>champions</strong> to fill up your war wagon. Each comes with their own <strong>moveset</strong> and <strong>random traits</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every campaign plays out differently with <strong>new tribes</strong>, <strong>new maps</strong> and<strong> war-hungry island spirits</strong> eager to see you fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Fight and Command at Once</strong> \u2013 Hack and slash enemies with powerful abilities while directing your lads in real-time battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>Conquer the Island</strong> \u2013 Expand territory, capture outposts, and outsmart rival tribes across a procedurally generated map.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Recruit Champions</strong> \u2013 Each tribe has unique heroes with special attacks and traits that completely change how battles unfold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfd5\ufe0f <strong>Command Your Villagers</strong> \u2013 Collect villagers to issue new orders: heal your lads, invest gold, or toss a few lads into the sacrificial pit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f <strong>Build and Upgrade</strong> \u2013 Construct gold mines, garages, and trebuchets, then strengthen them to power your growing war machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Tribes with Attitude</strong> \u2013 Pick from Beasts, Ronin, Mad, Knights, Slashers, and Synths. Each has their own abilities, units, and distinctive style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd01 <strong>Highly Replayable</strong> \u2013 Short campaigns packed with unpredictable encounters, escalating wars, and upgrades that turn your ragtag army into an unstoppable band of maniacs.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3377150?t=1768527900","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/c51f2750c1488c1946588f53037e2900567b5b85/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768527900","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/20cb05ef818b5755598c2f9eef6366b4e0c1bc7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768527900","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/20cb05ef818b5755598c2f9eef6366b4e0c1bc7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768527900","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We wanted big war strategy without the time commitment. Plan on a turn-based map, fight the battles in real time, and lead tribes like the Synths and Ronin through short, replayable campaigns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/b7e968bb0464897b58e0328417640977.webp?t=1768527900\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3377150/extras/de3b729ffb3b5ac4d27a649c218427ac.poster.avif?t=1768527900\" width=1170 height=380 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati